          <a href="#walk-or-run-speed" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">9. Picking a Speed: What a Mile Should Feel Like</a>
          <a href="#distance-vs-time-goals" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">10. Setting a Goal: Distance or Time?</a>
